' Dependencies
'========================
 
UC02 ..> UC03 : uses Roles
UC02 ..> UC04 : uses Permissions
UC02 ..> UC05 : assigned to Facility
 
UC06 ..> UC05 : Facility required
UC07 ..> UC05 : Facility required
 
UC08 ..> UC02 : identity lookup
UC08 ..> UC04 : permission lookup
 
UC11 ..> UC09 : governance data
UC12 ..> UC09 : governance data
UC13 ..> UC09 : governance data
UC14 ..> UC09 : governance data
 
UC11 ..> UC10 : session data
UC12 ..> UC10 : device sessions
 
@enduml